// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Jose_Escalante 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Jose Escalante 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1913302769" "Jose Escalante"
// ProfessionString :
"P98318701" "Defender of Commerce"
// DescriptionString :
"P1670916081" "Jose Escalante is a man with a mission. It's his goal to make sure Paragon City remains a place where business gets done. A self-described 'rabid capitalist,' Jose uses his many connections to put together mergers and assist businesses large and small. He's learned the hard way that the biggest roadblock to profits in Paragon City isn't regulation or zoning ordinances; it's the darned super villains. And so Jose found himself an interesting and profitable niche to fill: he helps connect businesses with heroes who can protect their interests. He's no simple security broker, however. Jose concentrates on solving specific, acute problems: emergency situations that need taking care of right away. To do that he relies on a cadre of friendly heroes who are eager to help out, sometimes for profit, but usually because it's the right thing to do. As Jose says, it's the perfect business arrangement: everyone wins, except the villain. "
// HelloString :
"P829183699" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There is work to be done.</A> "
// HelloString :
"P4288945723" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>It's a big city, with few heroes. Let's get cracking.</A> "
// HelloString :
"P3732151774" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have uncovered something that I think will interest you.</A> "
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3061679298" "Please speak to {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1119125096" "There are a number of trouble spots I could use your help with, {HeroName}. It is an honor to be working with you."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3948309001" "My agenda is cleared, thanks to you. It's been a pleasure."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P692593754" "You don't have time to take on another task."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2194519028" "I've got a new case, but my client wants someone with Security Level {Level} or higher."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P544558975" "You are a good person to have as a friend. I hope these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> will help you keep Paragon City running smoothly. Please call if you get into trouble."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2063517813" "This has been a profitable partnership. Glad we entered into it, {HeroName}. Try out some of these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4130724915" "You have moved into circles that even I don't dare travel in. Be well, and be careful."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P605884581" "You should introduce yourself to Jose Escalante, an important businessman who helps heroes fight criminals who impact business and commerce, such as the Council and the Devouring Earth. He works mostly with mutants and has access to Focus and Genetic Alteration Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P4199904348" "Choose Jose Escalante"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P362282792" "Jose is the kind of person that has kept Paragon City running, despite all the disasters we've faced. We can all learn a lot from him."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1742361545" "This person I know, <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>{ContactName}</A>, wants to meet you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2687356473" "Let me introduce you to some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friends of mine.</A>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


