// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Merisel Valenzuela 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P716067109" "Merisel Valenzuela"
// ProfessionString :
"P110452598" "Investigator"
// DescriptionString :
"P2089251442" "Merisel describes herself as freelance investigator. In reality, she's part hacker, part reporter, and part private eye. She made her fortune in the dot-com craze before the Rikti War and continues to do security consulting for a number of high profile Internet companies. But lately she finds herself fighting against big business more often than protecting it. She's famous for her outspoken advocacy of small businesses, open source software, and other causes that she thinks of as 'societal equalizers.' Her online persona is a closely guarded secret, but more than a few people suspect that she's the renowned hacker, Cipher, who's been responsible for several acts of anti-corporate cyber-espionage."
// HelloString :
"P1321664398" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I've got something for you.</A> "
// HelloString :
"P2694541537" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Trouble is brewing.</A> "
// HelloString :
"P2414884795" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have some good info.</A> "
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3422994757" "I think you want {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3966526029" "Lets find out what we can do together to let freedom ring. Sound good?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P417406569" "I am all out of problems to solve. Thanks for the assist."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3205344812" "Your in box already looks full to me."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2164034065" "I'm afraid the rest of my jobs call for someone with Security Level {Level} or higher."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2236335713" "You are a worthy friend. Check out the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> I turned up in one of my investigations. Please don't hesitate to call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1531564081" "This relationship has been tended well, and it's been fruitful for us both. I'm certain these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> will aid you."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1406318770" "You have moved to another level, my friend. Don't ever become what we hate."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P846852737" "Merisel Valenzuela is dedicated to freedom, especially freedom of information. She has many details on the Devouring Earth and the Council. She's very dedicated to her work with mutants and has access to Focus and Genetic Alteration enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2429733862" "Choose Merisel Valenzuela"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3025431711" "Good luck with Merisel, I think you will find her point of view refreshing."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1425052047" "I think you would get along well with <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>{ContactName}.</A>"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2959325238" "You would do well to meet <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>some other friends of mine.</A>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


