// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Peter_Stemitz 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Peter Stemitz 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1317843658" "Peter Stemitz"
// ProfessionString :
"P587076518" "Shaman"
// DescriptionString :
"P401556393" "Peter Stemitz's body is the most recent home of an ancient shaman who has been reborn for thousands of years. In his head is an encyclopedic knowledge of spiritual matters and a phenomenal amount of magical ability. Beneath that head is the body of a 23-year-old guitarist who plays in a punk rock band on the weekends and has been known to use his magic for impressing women, rather than saving the world. Fortunately, you can't have an ancient spirit in your body without having a conscience to go with it. Peter genuinely cares for people of the world, and he's happy to use his wisdom to help the heroes who defend them. If he also happens to get free drinks by magically curing the bartender's acne, so much the better."
// HelloString :
"P1123301785" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>How is it with you, fellow righter of wrongs? Seen any babes today?</A> "
// HelloString :
"P2567985714" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>It is time once again for us to face our foes. After that, drinks are on me.</A> "
// HelloString :
"P263091106" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let's hurry this up; I have a gig later.</A> "
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P639311922" "I know you not. Buzz off. Go talk with {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3379928177" "Greetings, kindred spirit of good. I hope we will assist each other down the path toward triumph over evil. The villains are many, and we are but two, but I have faith in your abilities."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2672015945" "You have laid bare my larder of tasks. Nothing to do now but party!"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P86755811" "Whoa, {HeroName}! You've got to learn to take it easy. No more tasks for you!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2178094439" "I've got something, but it's wicked scary. Get to Security Level {Level}, and it's yours."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P600406556" "You are a friend indeed! Check out the killer <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> I scored. Call me up anytime; we'll hang."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3566087410" "You are truly a boon companion. I have some new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> for you to take a gander at."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2694315769" "Our time together has passed. It was great meeting you, {HeroName}. Come see me play sometime."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2548540360" "Peter Stemitz is an interesting case. People say the soul of an ancient shaman dwells within him. Both souls speak through Peter's body, which can be a little disconcerting. He has a great deal of knowledge about the Circle of Thorns and the Council. He works primarily with magic heroes, and has access to Relic and Focus Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1538582686" "Choose Peter Stemitz"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3046525946" "Be warned, Peter and the shaman will both speak to you. Expect the shift in speech."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2976398745" "There is<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>one</A> I would wish you to meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P372136043" "Couple of <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</A> I know want to meetcha."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************
